    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have signed a contract in blood with a clan of summon-beasts &mdash; toads of Mount Myōboku, snakes of Ryūchi Cave, slugs of Shikkotsu Forest, or another such pact. You channel chakra to call them across realms and fight beside them. Your bond defines as much of your fighting style as your jutsu.</p>\n<p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 8 + Constitution</p>\n<p><strong>Key Attribute</strong> Charisma</p>\n<p><strong>Initial Proficiencies</strong> trained in simple weapons and unarmed; trained in light armor and unarmored defense; trained Fortitude and Reflex, expert Will; trained in Nature plus 4 additional skills</p>\n<p><strong>Spellcasting</strong> full chakra caster; spell DCs and attack rolls use Charisma. Your jutsu favor the <em>summoning</em> and <em>conjuration</em> traits.</p>\n<p>At 1st level you gain the shared chakra-core features plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtSummonerSpc0]{Summoner Specialization} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtSummonerPth0]{Summoning Contract}.</p>"
    },
